When PMPL is formally recognised, the SPDX identifier `MPL-2.0`
in source files takes full effect; no re-labelling is required.

The full MPL-2.0 text is available at https://www.mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/
and is included in this repository as `LICENSE-MPL-2.0` for crate /
package registries that require an OSI-approved licence text on disk.

